{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01372-s03","batch":1372,"shard":3,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":60,"shard_end_exclusive":80,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:22c84ecc6283b698324cdcbf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你能成为我的训练员真是太好啦……\r\n没！我什么都没说！","source_fingerprint":"0d68259cc0909eaf51c77faf1b78ddf56f5276c357474bcf8414ebe57f0a5bd9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93000"],"target_text":"Thật tốt vì cậu đã trở thành Trainer của tôi……\r\nKh-không! Tôi có nói gì đâu!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:505d2b7bf41b72b790efc56b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你能成为我的训练员……真是太好了！","source_fingerprint":"73ddcc957447a3dc3a280bac6ac39925ad436e348353567b32fb6ba16da1c557","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93001"],"target_text":"Cậu trở thành Trainer của tôi…… thật sự tốt quá!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:ba78662152f52f399fb60ed4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就算这样，我还是很感谢你……\r\n我、我才没有撒谎啦！","source_fingerprint":"3f381443525b6fe4e493d76bf3f1d90568532caa7df2d11341591cf75ded2a7c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93002"],"target_text":"Dù vậy, tôi vẫn rất cảm kích cậu……\r\nT-tôi đâu có nói dối!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:e934dd978ec514ff810ffd31","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就算这样，我还是很感谢你……谢谢！","source_fingerprint":"08cad2782e313e6c577f0c81b0cff94b71e5b7c28bf343b85d889042a8757309","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93003"],"target_text":"Dù vậy, tôi vẫn rất cảm kích cậu…… Cảm ơn!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:ef4f4fcfceab0a49018a2759","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"和你在一起的话，大概……\r\n能去到世界上的任何地方……吧……","source_fingerprint":"d9ab89c0e259143a60baa4a4b0d2503b540f59d54c74888e381f4b62f622610c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93004"],"target_text":"Nếu ở bên cậu thì chắc là……\r\ntôi có thể đi đến bất cứ nơi nào trên thế giới…… nhỉ……","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":65,"uid":"zhcn:ac683b884930aa4a84bd6ca6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"这一路上所留下的回忆，\r\n就是最棒的伴手礼呢。","source_fingerprint":"847315d9e3b7a2592e763006c1e02c419088cb12d232dff928b39b7c13c80d83","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93005"],"target_text":"Những kỷ niệm lưu lại suốt hành trình này\r\nchính là món quà mang về tuyệt nhất nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:aafe44595f6b7e52c957cfbe","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"和你在一起的话，\r\n我们一定能去到世界上的任何地方！","source_fingerprint":"ba9aa8ae1f060c538ed438ee21cbda78cfd21484dc870acf2b4a0418688ae45c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","93006"],"target_text":"Nếu ở bên cậu,\r\nchúng ta nhất định có thể đi đến bất cứ nơi nào trên thế giới!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:fb7b9a55445466dae9a80d2d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就算是我，还是能继续进步的……！","source_fingerprint":"86da3d77697f39a241618f35108de5a8730c7e4f5e8cb7ec2f8e3721ae9fc7b0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95000"],"target_text":"Ngay cả tôi cũng vẫn có thể tiếp tục tiến bộ……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:13afdefee67edba514eedd65","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"必须要超越自己的极限……！","source_fingerprint":"faeb84e40799e87b86bf6f3a1c357409fcac7eb3da43422df336a9b9695d958c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95001"],"target_text":"Phải vượt qua giới hạn của chính mình……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:4a1c4f5901f821c24ef22505","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"目白多伯……嗯。那个，请多指教。","source_fingerprint":"a3b62623111057a3faddb7bb685be3582ccc0bb87198d766882dfe7074c97758","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95003"],"target_text":"Mejiro Dober…… Ừm. Mong được cậu giúp đỡ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":70,"uid":"zhcn:5bf904b10e90e3b6f970d32c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我想要改变自己……！\r\n所以，我必须要继续奔跑！","source_fingerprint":"7dca829fbce8bb22ba4ff8f1b36550e1ef6fa7579b7884a4da591b736b1060a8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95004"],"target_text":"Tôi muốn thay đổi bản thân……!\r\nVì thế, tôi phải tiếp tục chạy!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":71,"uid":"zhcn:24db8b6c57dc86f4eb275879","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"能做到的事情，变多了呢。","source_fingerprint":"e361b9645dfbae7e806777b1a462464ed4d61f1427ab7d353f28d45933a7a4e4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95005"],"target_text":"Những việc tôi làm được đã nhiều hơn rồi nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":72,"uid":"zhcn:a7feaf63bc8ef25a99de17c6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我也想尽一份力……！","source_fingerprint":"8dd2adaaf63cc7505cff5d221d39ddfe11332a625220bdfa5c9c40b53e04f22e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95006"],"target_text":"Tôi cũng muốn góp một phần sức mình……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":73,"uid":"zhcn:0dde53fe5a6aa66d7e717577","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"还想再继续冒险……！","source_fingerprint":"65356ff64dc5462b72b78fa2249ea29168325a29e4a0ad768098e79a60288d50","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95007"],"target_text":"Tôi vẫn muốn tiếp tục phiêu lưu nữa……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":74,"uid":"zhcn:bef6a08a361f8d949ac1869d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"机会难得，\r\n要不要去哪儿玩玩作为纪念？","source_fingerprint":"fa37751c0e489cc94d0a0a9ba0753c8accfd70400936d3f0196c7785f2d7f307","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95008"],"target_text":"Cơ hội hiếm có thế này,\r\nhay mình đi đâu đó chơi để làm kỷ niệm nhé?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":75,"uid":"zhcn:0d835bb98090d29e22f5507b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要去哪儿玩玩吗？\r\n……就当是……转换心情。","source_fingerprint":"6bea6de564881506e1029886db42f56cdec7c9227f4244eebb5c24676d4696b4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95009"],"target_text":"Đi đâu đó chơi không?\r\n……Cứ coi như là…… đổi gió một chút.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":76,"uid":"zhcn:2985745508ca58d753ee12e0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"帽子没问题……\r\n……目白多伯。请多指教。","source_fingerprint":"7661a7d43c77812ce285914e6e5466ee35860f28c300bbedf9c9ee6a48fe832a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1059","95010"],"target_text":"Mũ ổn rồi……\r\n……Mejiro Dober. Mong được cậu giúp đỡ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":77,"uid":"zhcn:8fbd7d46fc6fd05bc3a3563c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就这么做吧ー。","source_fingerprint":"d7a30040f9c2e7ee208d423ba5aaf6ed44a624cfc4e1311360628b766e148a0b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","1000"],"target_text":"Cứ làm vậy điー.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":78,"uid":"zhcn:cdb428eddf6f6deb2e26e403","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"虽然说这种幼稚的话，\n可不是我的角色。\n…加油哦。和你一起。","source_fingerprint":"679c79ce61dfd1a3fa3ce7beaa1b0174792a1acf1ad5c8214ff7fb816f53da24","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","10000"],"target_text":"Nói mấy lời trẻ con thế này\nkhông giống tôi chút nào.\n…Cố lên nhé. Cùng với cậu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":79,"uid":"zhcn:a61a7453f72bbd85f4db2f38","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"行ってくんねー。","source_fingerprint":"8e992b661980cfdc645293714d6dcb74716c24bc66579c780a165c1440c12bbc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1060","100000"],"target_text":"Tôi đi đây nhéー.","reviewed":true}]}